attle 4 Atlantis</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/24/0U2A2304.JPG" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 18:32:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>9</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59758</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Welcome No. 20 Baylor for Final Regular-Season Ranked Matchup</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/24/volleyball-mountaineers-welcome-no-20-baylor-for-final-regular-season-ranked-matchup</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/24/volleyball-mountaineers-welcome-no-20-baylor-for-final-regular-season-ranked-matchup</guid><category>Volleyball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="WVU Volleyball team huddles before the start of a match" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/11/24/VB_WVUvsUCF_Nov15_2026_JC_575.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The West Virginia University volleyball team (13-13, 6-10 Big 12) welcomes its final ranked opponent of the regular season to Hope Coliseum on Wednesday, Nov. 25, as the Mountaineers host No. 20 Baylor. First serve is set for 2 p.m. ET.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/24/VB_WVUvsUCF_Nov15_2026_JC_575.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/24/VB_WVUvsUCF_Nov15_2026_JC_575.jpg"><media:title>WVU Volleyball team huddles before the start of a match</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/24/VB_WVUvsUCF_Nov15_2026_JC_575.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:15:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>17</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59757</s:story_id></i